<title>NEW ZEALAND: St Lukes lifts half yr profit by 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>St Lukes lifts half yr profit by 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to Dec 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 14.59 vs 13.62</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   6.14 vs 5.80</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			   6.03 vs 5.67</p>
<p>    Turnover			     34.16 vs 31.97</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			18.34 vs 17.43</p>
<p>    Tax				     3.75 vs 3.81</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   133.3 vs 125.6</p>
<p>Dividend carries 1.990780 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date March 11</p>
<p>Reg date February 28</p>
<p>Ex div   March 3</p>
<p>Note - St Lukes Group is a shopping mall owner.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
